{"unit_id": "tag:034C:proof", "translation": "我们将利用引理<REF_0001>。首先注意，“局部诺特（locally Noetherian）”是Zariski拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。这从定义即可看出，见性质（Properties）定义<REF_0002>。接着证明，若<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affines）之间的平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0002>局部诺特（locally Noetherian），则<MATH_0003>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）。这就是态射（Morphisms）引理<REF_0003>。最后，必须证明，若<MATH_0004>是仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0005>局部诺特（locally Noetherian），则<MATH_0006>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）。这由代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0004>推出。因此引理<REF_0005>的(1)、(2)、(3)成立，证明完成。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表现"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表现"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "所检验的局部诺特性，待决"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "Zariski拓扑，待决"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "性质的局部性，待决"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "引用章节名，待决"},